<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Forest Labs started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Forest Labs started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer and Co analyst Steven Gerber initiated coverage of Forest Laboratories Inc with a buy rating and a 12-month $50 price target, his office said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst estimates the company will post a loss of $0.82 a share in its fiscal year ending March 1997, a profit of $1.68 a share in fiscal 1998, and a profit of $2.50 in fiscal 1999.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 at 32-7/8.</p>
</text>
